     @0[Return to EZ-ICE]         @-1[Previous Screen]         @179[General Info]

This sub-menu controls the command line related functions of the EZ-ICE.  Choices 
within this sub-menu are:

                  @77[Command  Line]   - Command line editor 
                  @85[Command  Output] - Command Output

