Execution Menu Option
     @0[Return to EZ-ICE]         @-1[Previous Screen]         @179[General Info]

This sub-menu controls execution related functions of the EZ-ICE.  Choices
within this sub-menu are:

   @119[Run]                        - Executes code on target
   @117[Step]                       - Executes a single step
   @118[Step 'n' Times]             - Executes 'n' single steps
   @171[Display Breakpoints]        - Displays all breakpoints
   @169[Set/Clear Breakpoint]       - Sets/Clears a breakpoint
   @172[Clear All Breakpoints]      - Clears all breakpoints

