Display Menu Option
     @0[Return to EZ-ICE]         @-1[Previous Screen]         @179[General Info]

This sub-menu controls display related functions of the EZ-ICE.  Choices
within this sub-menu are:

 @71[Color Attributes]     - Display/Modify the color attributes of the display
 @19[Video Mode]           - Display/Modify the video mode of the display
 @18[Toggle Window Format] - Toggles window display format
 @8[List Windows]         - List all open windows
 @7[Center Windows]       - Centers all open windows
 @6[Redraw Display]       - Redraws the display

