Misc Menu Option
     @0[Return to EZ-ICE]         @-1[Previous Screen]         @179[General Info]

This sub-menu controls miscellaneous functions of the EZ-ICE.  Choices within
this sub-menu are:

              @69[Chip Reset]         - Simulates a chip reset signal
              @70[Emulator Reset]     - Reset emulator host program
              @90[Expressions ]       - Display expressions
              @20[About EZ-ICE...]    - EZ-ICE Information

