Quit Menu Option
     @0[Return to EZ-ICE]         @-1[Previous Screen]         @179[General Info]

This sub-menu controls functions related to exiting EZ-ICE.  Choices within
this sub-menu are:

                @2[Exit] - Exit EZ-ICE and update window file
                @3[Quit] - Exit EZ-ICE without updating window file

